---

<div class="mhs">
  <p class="statement">
    <span>MHS is for labs, in a closed preview.</span>
    <span>OpenHAL is open and works today.</span>
    <span>We plan to be compatible.</span>
  </p>
  <div class="facts">
    <dl>
      <div>
        <dt class="legend">MHS</dt>
        <dd>
          Anthropic previewed it on August 27, 2026, for labs and advanced manufacturing. Access is by application. No public spec yet.
        </dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt class="legend">OpenHAL</dt>
        <dd>
          Apache 2.0, for makers and small labs. The same read and write model, so device files can map onto MHS when its spec is public.
        </dd>
      </div>
    </dl>
    <p><a href="/spec/mhs-mapping/">How the spec maps onto MHS today</a></p>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .mhs {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--s-6);
  }

  .statement {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--s-1);
    font-family: var(--font-label);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: var(--t-4);
    line-height: var(--lh-4);
    letter-spacing: -0.005em;
  }

  .statement span:last-child {
    color: var(--ink-2);
  }

  dl {
    margin: 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--s-4);
  }

  dl > div {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--s-1);
    padding-top: var(--s-3);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }

  dt {
    color: var(--ink-2);
  }

  dd {
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 60ch;
  }

  .facts > p {
    margin-top: var(--s-4);
  }

  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .mhs {
      grid-template-columns: 6fr 6fr;
      gap: var(--s-7);
    }
  }
</style>
